---
import Shell from '../../layouts/Shell.astro';
import SoundsReadingTrail from '../../components/SoundsReadingTrail.astro';
import story from '../../../../../kb/research/culture/sankha-website.json';
---
<Shell title={story.title} description={story.lead} active="explore" wide related={false}>
<article class="wrap sankha-story"><a class="text-link collection-return" href="/sounds-of-odisha/#sankha">← Sounds of Odisha</a>
<header class="sankha-hero"><div><p class="eyebrow">Sounds of Odisha · ଶଙ୍ଖ</p><h1>Sankha.<br/><em>The sound of arrival.</em></h1><p class="lead">{story.lead}</p></div><figure><img src="/images/sounds/sankha-at-rest.webp" width="1536" height="1024" alt={story.photo.alt} fetchpriority="high"/><figcaption>{story.photo.caption}</figcaption></figure></header>
<div class="sankha-reading">{story.blocks.map(b=><section>{b.title&&<h2>{b.title}</h2>}{b.items.length>0&&<ul>{b.items.map(p=><li>{p}</li>)}</ul>}{b.paragraphs.map(p=><p>{p}</p>)}</section>)}
<p class="notice">A sourced reader story. Practitioner/language review remains open; no audio recording or current performance booking is provided.</p>
<p><a href="/literature/">Explore Odia literature →</a> · <a href="/sounds-of-odisha/huluhuli/">Meet Huluhuli →</a></p>
<details class="utk-disclosure sankha-credits"><summary>Sources, artwork &amp; reading notes</summary><p>{story.limits} Desk review: {story.reviewed_on}.</p><ul>{story.sources.map(s=><li><a href={s.resource}>{s.title}</a></li>)}</ul><p>The Met object is from Vanuatu, not Odisha. Historic wedding and diaspora accounts retain their dates and scope. The commemorative voyage passage is attributed writing, not proof of an ancient departure ceremony. No audio playback or current event verification claimed.</p><h3>Artwork</h3><p>{story.photo.provenance} {story.photo.changes}</p></details>
<p><a href="/contribute/?page=%2Fsounds-of-odisha%2Fsankha%2F">Suggest a correction or a public source</a>. GitHub submissions are public; omit private contact details and consent documents.</p><SoundsReadingTrail slug="sankha"/></div>
</article></Shell>
<style>.sankha-story{padding-bottom:70px}.collection-return{display:inline-block;margin:28px 0}.sankha-hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1.1fr;gap:clamp(28px,5vw,100px);align-items:center;margin:12px 0 52px}.sankha-hero h1{font-size:clamp(48px,5vw,84px);line-height:1.08}.sankha-hero h1 em{color:var(--sea)}.sankha-hero figure{margin:0}.sankha-hero img{width:100%;height:auto}.sankha-hero figcaption{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:10px}.sankha-reading{max-width:900px;margin:auto;font-size:19px;line-height:1.85}.sankha-reading section{margin-bottom:40px}.sankha-reading h2{font-size:clamp(30px,3vw,44px);line-height:1.2;margin:36px 0 18px}.sankha-reading li{margin:12px 0}.sankha-credits{font-size:16px;overflow-wrap:anywhere;margin:30px 0}.sankha-credits li{margin:10px 0}@media(max-width:760px){.sankha-hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:24px;margin-bottom:30px}.sankha-hero h1{font-size:46px}.sankha-reading{font-size:17px}.sankha-reading section{margin-bottom:28px}}</style>
